      "id": 5,
      "text": "Arduino UNO R3 (experimental) running avr328_serial at 16 MHz, uploaded as the Arduino IDE would.\nRun (F5) and open the terminal (USB): it greets; l toggles the L LED (D13), t prints the temperature\nsensor's code, ? prints how many bytes arrived (a count kept in the EEPROM). To upload from the Arduino\nIDE, set USB to the computer to one end of a virtual port pair and upload to the other end while it runs."
    }
